<h2>6. Installation &amp; Execution Instructions</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Extract Archive:</strong> Extract the contents of <code>BeautyOfBeaches_Premium_Professional.zip</code> to any desired local folder (e.g., <code>C:\BeautyOfBeaches</code> or desktop).</li>
  <li><strong>Method A (Direct Local Launch):</strong> Double-click on <code>index.html</code> to open the web portal directly in Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, or Mozilla Firefox. All assets, stylesheets, scripts, videos, and fonts are configured to operate seamlessly via relative paths.</li>
  <li><strong>Method B (Local HTTP Web Server - Recommended):</strong> 
    <p>For optimal video streaming and HTML5 Geolocation execution, run a local web server:</p>
    <div class="code-box">
# Using Node.js http-server:
npx http-server -p 5501
    </div>
    <p>Navigate to <code>http://127.0.0.1:5501/</code> or <code>http://localhost:5501/</code> in your web browser.</p>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Verifying Deliverable Features:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surfing Lottie Preloader:</strong> Refresh the page to experience the vector surfing animation with realistic water splash.</li>
      <li><strong>Continuous Scrolling Ticker:</strong> Observe the fixed bottom ticker showing live date, real-time PKT seconds clock, and detected coordinates via HTML5 Geolocation.</li>
      <li><strong>PDF &amp; DOC Exporter:</strong> Click "View Details" on any beach card (e.g. Kund Malir Beach) and select either "Download PDF" or "Download DOC" to test instant client-side file generation.</li>
      <li><strong>Visitor Count &amp; Hover Effects:</strong> Inspect the top-right counter badge beside the brand logo and test the menu color shift on hover and active click transitions.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>

